title: Poland's European Campaign
subtitle: Relationships built over years can become a Polish agenda rather than a photograph.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_foreign_card
frequency: 150
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_european_campaign_timer <= 0 and eu_campaign_complete = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_european_campaign_timer = 4; foreign_cards_resolved += 1
card-image: img/poland/cards/palace-mediation.webp

= Poland's European campaign

**Stage:** [+ eu_campaign_stage +] · **influence:** [+ eu_influence +]/100  
Brussels trust **[+ eu_institutional_trust +]** · European left **[+
eu_left_network +]** · eastern coalition **[+ eu_eastern_coalition +]**  
Berlin **[+ germany_relation +]** · Paris **[+ france_relation +]**

The inherited Weimar strategy was patient: improve several relationships,
survive elections abroad, and only then attempt the larger settlement. Modern
Poland has more channels and less freedom to pretend they are interchangeable.
A Commission file, a socialist-party congress, a defence meeting and the
Weimar Triangle each buy a different kind of leverage.

- @brussels
- @social
- @eastern
- @triangle
- @compact
- @briefing

@brussels
title: Establish a permanent Lewica Brussels and parliamentary mission
subtitle: Institutional trust +8, EU influence +6 and constitutional restraint +2.
view-if: eu_brussels_mission = 0
on-arrival: eu_brussels_mission = 1; eu_campaign_progress += 1; eu_institutional_trust += 8; eu_influence += 6; constitutional_restraint += 2; ko_relation += 1; pis_relation -= 1; foreign_pressure -= 2; news_headline = "Lewica builds a European channel that survives one government"

Officials, MEPs and parliamentary staff receive one shared calendar. The
channel can defend Polish interests without claiming every Commission demand
is either salvation or occupation.

- #poland_card_finish

@social
title: Build a wages, housing and public-services alliance
subtitle: European-left network +9, labour credibility +4 and EU influence +5.
view-if: eu_social_mission = 0
on-arrival: eu_social_mission = 1; eu_campaign_progress += 1; eu_left_network += 9; eu_influence += 5; labor_credibility += 4; workers_support += 2; ko_relation -= 1; news_headline = "The European campaign acquires a material programme"

Trade unions, municipal housing advocates and sister parties agree that
European integration must be measured in bargaining power and public services,
not only in flags and fiscal ceilings.

- #poland_card_finish

@eastern
title: Convene Baltic, Nordic and eastern-flank sister parties
subtitle: Eastern coalition +9, military trust +3 and Ukraine solidarity +3.
view-if: eu_eastern_mission = 0
on-arrival: eu_eastern_mission = 1; eu_campaign_progress += 1; eu_eastern_coalition += 9; eu_influence += 5; military_trust += 3; ukraine_solidarity += 3; war_escalation_risk -= 1; left_atlanticist_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The Left treats Europe's eastern flank as a political coalition"

Security becomes more than a procurement slogan. Parties from states nearest
Russia connect deterrence, Ukrainian sovereignty, civil defence, energy and
the capacity of local services to absorb a shock.

- #poland_card_finish

@triangle
title: Open Lewica channels in Warsaw, Berlin and Paris
subtitle: Germany +7, France +7 and EU influence +6; the anti-German shortcut weakens.
view-if: eu_triangle_mission = 0
on-arrival: eu_triangle_mission = 1; eu_campaign_progress += 1; germany_relation += 7; france_relation += 7; eu_influence += 6; public_trust += 1; pis_relation -= 2; far_right_agenda -= 1; news_headline = "Lewica opens durable political channels in the three capitals"

Party, union and municipal contacts do not reopen an intergovernmental summit.
Economic, defence and rule-of-law disputes remain. Regular contact makes it
harder for any capital to use surprise as leverage—and harder for Polish
politicians to replace a negotiation with an anti-German headline.

- #poland_card_finish

@compact
title: Publish the Warsaw compact for a social and secure Europe
subtitle: Requires three completed missions and 42 EU influence.
choose-if: eu_campaign_progress >= 3 and eu_influence >= 42
unavailable-subtitle: The European network is not yet broad enough to carry a common programme.
view-if: eu_campaign_progress >= 3
on-arrival: eu_campaign_complete = 1; eu_campaign_stage = "Warsaw compact — social security, democratic law and eastern defence"; eu_influence += 10; eu_institutional_trust += 5; eu_left_network += 5; eu_eastern_coalition += 5; labor_credibility += 3; military_trust += 3; constitutional_restraint += 3; public_trust += 4; left_poll_momentum += 0.3; foreign_pressure -= 5; news_headline = "A Polish Left programme joins social Europe to eastern security"

The compact is not a new union and does not abolish national disagreement. It
does give the Left a recognisable European offer: democratic institutions,
social investment, energy resilience, Ukrainian sovereignty and defence
burdens that do not arrive as unexplained cuts to hospitals and housing.

- #poland_card_finish

@briefing
title: Keep every channel open without choosing the next objective
subtitle: No resource cost. External pressure −1, but the campaign does not advance.
on-arrival: foreign_pressure -= 1; public_trust += 1 if eu_campaign_progress >= 2; news_headline = "European contacts continue without a new common commitment"

The delegation returns with useful telephone numbers and no promise that could
split the alliance. Maintenance matters; it is not a strategy.

- #poland_card_finish
